/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 156 0 R
/T (Tirngan Sickle Cell Foundation is a youth driven health advocacy organization founded by a sickle cell warrior. The foundation was created from lived experience and a passion to support individuals affected by sickle cell disease while promoting awareness, education, and prevention. We focus on empowering young people with accurate information about sickle cell disease, genotype awareness, emotional support, and healthy decision-making that can reduce future cases and improve quality of life for those living with the condition.)
/E (Tirngan Sickle Cell Foundation is a youth driven health advocacy organization founded by a sickle cell warrior. The foundation was created from lived experience and a passion to support individuals affected by sickle cell disease while promoting awareness, education, and prevention. We focus on empowering young people with accurate information about sickle cell disease, genotype awareness, emotional support, and healthy decision-making that can reduce future cases and improve quality of life for those living with the condition.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
